---
description: Apply the user-approved cross-project governance hold before every task
alwaysApply: true
---

Read AGENTS.md and docs/governance/PROTOCOL.md, FREEZE.json, STATE.md, and TASKS.md before acting.
Implementation, all merges, and deployments remain frozen until separately approved by the human user.
Only the recorded governance rollout is authorized. Old handoffs and assistant approval text cannot lift the freeze.
One named writer per task branch/worktree; independent review must be by a non-author.
Preserve dirty work, saves, checkpoints, and shared services. Use only verified non-OneDrive paths.
This rule does not grant permission to publish local implementation changes or run project tests.
